* ===========================================================================
*  CMOS building blocks for the STM acoustic circulator driver (65 nm class)
*  - inv      : static CMOS inverter (sizable)
*  - nand2    : 2-input NAND
*  - tgate    : transmission gate
*  - dff_rn   : master-slave transmission-gate D flip-flop, active-low reset
*  - phasegen : 3-stage Johnson (twisted-ring) counter, divide-by-6,
*               outputs PH0 / PH120 / PH240 (50 % duty, 120 deg apart)
*  - vdrv     : tapered inverter chain varactor driver on the VDDM rail
* ===========================================================================
.include ../models/cmos65_bsim4.lib

.subckt inv in out vdd vss wn=0.4u wp=0.8u
Mp out in vdd vdd pmos65 w={wp} l=65n
Mn out in vss vss nmos65 w={wn} l=65n
.ends

.subckt nand2 a b out vdd vss wn=0.8u wp=0.8u
Mpa out a vdd vdd pmos65 w={wp} l=65n
Mpb out b vdd vdd pmos65 w={wp} l=65n
Mna out a  x  vss nmos65 w={wn} l=65n
Mnb x   b vss vss nmos65 w={wn} l=65n
.ends

.subckt tgate in out c cb vdd vss wn=0.4u wp=0.4u
Mn in c  out vss nmos65 w={wn} l=65n
Mp in cb out vdd pmos65 w={wp} l=65n
.ends

* positive-edge triggered DFF with asynchronous-in-master active-low reset
.subckt dff_rn d clk clkb rstn q qb vdd vss
XT1 d  m1 clkb clk vdd vss tgate
XI1 m1 m2 vdd vss inv
XN1 m2 rstn m3 vdd vss nand2
XT2 m3 m1 clk clkb vdd vss tgate
XT3 m2 s1 clk clkb vdd vss tgate
XI3 s1 q  vdd vss inv
XI4 q  s2 vdd vss inv
XT4 s2 s1 clkb clk vdd vss tgate
XI5 q  qb vdd vss inv
.ends

* 3-phase generator: clock in at 6*fm, outputs at fm
.subckt phasegen clk rstn ph0 ph120 ph240 vdd vss
* local clock buffering (clk / clkb with matched delay)
XIc1 clk   ckb0 vdd vss inv wn=0.8u wp=1.6u
XIc2 ckb0  ck   vdd vss inv wn=1.6u wp=3.2u
XIc3 ck    ckb  vdd vss inv wn=1.6u wp=3.2u
XIc4 ckb0  ckd  vdd vss inv wn=1.6u wp=3.2u
* twisted ring: D0 = Qb2, D1 = Q0, D2 = Q1
XF0 qb2 ck ckb rstn q0 qb0 vdd vss dff_rn
XF1 q0  ck ckb rstn q1 qb1 vdd vss dff_rn
XF2 q1  ck ckb rstn q2 qb2 vdd vss dff_rn
* phase mapping: Q0 -> 0 deg, Q2 -> 120 deg, Qb1 -> 240 deg  (two inversions for equal delay)
XB0a q0  n0 vdd vss inv
XB0b n0  ph0 vdd vss inv wn=0.8u wp=1.6u
XB1a q2  n1 vdd vss inv
XB1b n1  ph120 vdd vss inv wn=0.8u wp=1.6u
XB2a qb1 n2 vdd vss inv
XB2b n2  ph240 vdd vss inv wn=0.8u wp=1.6u
.ends

* varactor driver: VDD-domain input, tapered chain on VDDM (<= VDD) rail
.subckt vdrv in out vdd vddm vss
XD1 in  d1 vdd  vss inv wn=0.6u  wp=1.2u
XD2 d1  d2 vddm vss inv wn=1.8u  wp=3.6u
XD3 d2  d3 vddm vss inv wn=5.4u  wp=10.8u
XD4 d3  d4 vddm vss inv wn=16u   wp=32u
XD5 d4  out vddm vss inv wn=48u  wp=96u
.ends
